[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the collar badge with the proper tool. Operate on the\nindicated side.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.014.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Displace only a little the collar badge and disconnect the  electrical\nconnections (2a, 2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Adjustable mirror control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236128\">H30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Switches assembly on central console</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236137\">H35</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019319.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Make sure that the collar badge\nis not damaged and that the anchor fins be complete.</p><p>Connect the electrical  connections.</p><p>Install the collar badge.</p><p>Check the operation of the electrical controls.</p>"]]